    <edge id="e0" source="ont:accusation-channels" target="ont:popular-unrest">
      <data key="ek0">claim:d1c7-accusation-channels</data>
      <data key="ek1">machiavelli</data>
      <data key="ek2">Legal accusation channels (before the people or many judges) vent the humors that build up against citizens; where such ordinary outlets are absent, humors discharge through extraordinary modes that ruin the republic.</data>
      <data key="ek3">negative</data>
      <data key="ek4">causal-mechanism</data>
      <data key="ek5">disc:it:1:7</data>
      <data key="ek6">historically situated claim, not established causal fact</data>
    </edge>
