    <edge id="e45" source="ont:public-rich-citizens-poor" target="ont:institutional-survival">
      <data key="ek0">claim:d1c37-public-rich-citizens-poor</data>
      <data key="ek1">machiavelli</data>
      <data key="ek2">Well-ordered republics must keep the public treasury rich and their citizens poor.</data>
