      <data key="ek0">claim:d1c37-distance-decay</data>
      <data key="ek1">machiavelli</data>
      <data key="ek2">When conquered fields lay far from the plebs' eyes and in places hard to cultivate, they were less desired, and the agrarian humor subsided — resurging only with the Gracchi.</data>
      <data key="ek3">negative</data>
      <data key="ek4">causal-mechanism</data>
      <data key="ek5">disc:it:1:37</data>
